id: @(#)sabre.tok 1.0 26/11/07
purpose: The UltraSPARC IIi's PCI bus module (Sabre): /pci@1f,0
copyright: Copyright 2026 Andy Taylor

\ The host bridge of the Ultra 5 and 10: the IIi's own PCI bus module, with
\ its IOMMU, and the Advanced PCI Bridge (APB, "Simba") at device 1 of its
\ bus, whose two secondary buses carry everything else. Built on the
\ release's PCI bus package (obp/dev/pci), as its sun4v host bridge
\ (obp/dev/sun4v-devices/vpci) is.

fcode-version3

headerless

fload ${BP}/dev/sabre/regs.fth
fload ${BP}/dev/sabre/iommu.fth
fload ${BP}/dev/pci/pcibus.fth
fload ${BP}/dev/sabre/methods.fth

end0
